string for example.\r\nWith this PR if a `pylint:disable=line-too-long` pragma is present at the end of a docstring then it is valid for the entire docstring.\r\n\r\nEventually if this modification is not judged usefull, i will make another PR that will just reformat the `check_lines` method inside `pylint/checkers/format` module because i had some difficulties to read and understand it.\r\n\r\n## Type of Changes\r\n<!-- Leave the corresponding lines for the applicable type of change: -->\r\n|   | Type |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| ✓  | :bug: Bug fix  |\r\n| ✓  | :hammer: Refactoring  |\r\n\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\n\r\n<!-- \r\nIf this PR fixes a particular issue, use the following to automatically close that issue\r\nonce this PR gets merged:\r\n\r\nCloses #XXX \r\n-->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3076/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2810408137,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MjgxMDQwODEzNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/events/2810408137","actor":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/orgs","